    "text": "Let G = F · ⟨a⟩ be a Frobenius group with the complement ⟨a⟩ of prime order.\n   a) Is G locally finite if it is binary finite?\n   b) Is the kernel F locally finite if the groups ⟨a, ag ⟩ are finite for all g ∈ G?\n                                                                            V. P. Shunkov",
